WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
Akajin Yoshiichi [Shikabane Hime]
(published in the monthly [Shonen Gangan] from Square Enix)

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.490
Kougon Cult DAIRINKAN
Child Welfare institution

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.840
Hanagami Oori
Happy birthday

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:00.610
Oori.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.530
Bro?

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:54.870
Are you alright?

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:56.900
She’s cold.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.090
De—

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.350
She's dead.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.620
Could this have been an accident, great Buddha?

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.860
But why is nobody here?

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.560
Stop it!

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:23.540
Note: Shugo means cult leader
Shugo, please stop!

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.940
Shugo, you can't force yourself.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.460
She is already gone.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:36.480
Isn’t that Shirae-san that comes here every once in a while?

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.610
By Shugo, does he mean Bro?

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:42.280
How could she have gotten those wounds?

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:44.860
Who could that girl be?

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.340
Does it intrigue you?

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:49.390
That corpse I mean.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:50.220
What?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.270
There is something you can show to that corpse.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:54.720
That is...

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.920
Do it, Tagami!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.610
I am just a beginner, but I can do it.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.030
I may be able to make it.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.700
You should wait for a new one!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.190
She is a human being.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:26.640
Keisei...?

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:28.860
Forgive me.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.170
I’m sure that girl was dead.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:43.280
Presented By: Underground & Tomodachi

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:49.950
AKA
Shikabane Hime:
Presented By: Underground & Tomodachi

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:54.370
The Dance of Death

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.140
You must be Hagino.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:16.650
We've found seven corpses in your trash.

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.580
They must be from the women you were sleeping with.

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:29.240
What would you do if I told you someone in your Police Corps was causing crimes?

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:33.350
So, I punished them.

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.580
I’m just like you.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.290
Only I was the one who executed the punishment.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.470
What crimes did those women commit?

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.510
They disobeyed my orders.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:49.880
It’s a terrible crime.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:13.950
It's all thanks to the great Buddha that we can eat today.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.690
What the hell are you doing, Keisei?!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.930
Don't call me Keisei, I am the Priest of this household.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:35.890
Are you sure you are allowed to do this?

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.030
Listen up.

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:42.190
These days, there are those who build up positive perceptions of themselves...

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.760
...to hide behind while commiting evil acts.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:50.150
Do not be deceived by their facades, and search for the truth within them.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.230
Of course I am—

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.980
What are you telling them, Tagami-san?!

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.890
As the one responsible for this group, I...

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.960
This is the ground of the Sekkuuji temple.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.680
But I am the manager!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.720
Everyone, let's forget about this, okay?

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:16.160
Let’s share Tagami-san's breakfast with everyone, okay?

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:16.800
What?!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:17.680
Yeah!
What?!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.130
Manager?

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:22.390
Is it okay if I leave this in the hall?

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.870
Is it tonight that you’re moving out?

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:25.360
Yes.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.580
A friend from school is going to help me.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.910
What's wrong with you, Hanagami?!

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.930
Are you really moving out?!

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:34.540
It’s not Hanagami!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.460
It’s Kagami... Kagami!

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:36.890
I’m calling you Hanagami!

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.940
Hanagami! Hanagami!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.090
Ouch...

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.790
Whoa! Are you going to take all of that with you?!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.500
<b>Gravure Idol
Takada Setsuko, 19 years old
Beautiful
wives
Beautiful
teens
Yen
160 pages
Swingers</b>

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:55.320
Kagami
Oori

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.240
It’s you!
Kagami
Oori

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.160
You put all of this in my boxes!
Kagami
Oori

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:58.180
You put all of this in my boxes!

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:01.170
Isn’t your name written on it?

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:04.040
But this is your handwriting!

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:09.230
As your father I felt that you could have used these when you live on your own.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:10.700
I don’t need you to look after me in this way!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.330
And you’re not my father!

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:18.870
You’re right...

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:21.870
But you’ve been raised here too.

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:26.450
I really think of you as my older brother.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:30.830
Why are you going, Oori?

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:33.870
I’ll be in the neighborhood.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.270
I’ll come for dinner once in a while.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:39.450
It’s expensive.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.320
I’m off!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.810
I’ll come back immediately after school.

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:53.610
Please look over my things until then.

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.210
He’s going to work two jobs, he said.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:00.290
He probably felt uncomfortable here at his age.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:01.860
Just let him go his own way.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:03.900
But didn’t you notice?

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:09.790
The first time he thought of living on his own was last year, when you got wounded badly and had to stay in bed, Keisei.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.310
It all began that day.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.790
Was that so?

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:18.320
You always leave all of the sudden and come home wounded.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:22.730
I've gotten used to it, but Oori...

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.570
So the Dairinkan is closer to school?

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.450
No, but the rent is so expensive around here.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.320
So why are you living on your own then?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:23.080
The truth is that you got scared of the cemetery behind your house, right?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.710
Don’t say stupid things.

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:26.000
I’m not scared at all.

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:27.790
But you told us before right?

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.410
That you’ve seen dead people.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:32.530
Yeah, that’s because it's a temple.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.410
But it’s not scary at all.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.850
Anyway, that’s not really the problem.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.160
By the way, could you guys help me move my stuff?

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.350
Hey, you guys?!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.750
I need to go to my club.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.560
I’ve got my part time job.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.220
Shit! Let’s get out of here!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.160
Inuhiko?

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.430
Note: The name Inuhiko can be translated as “Dog Boy”.
Don’t call me by my first name.

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:55.580
I hate it.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:57.560
By the way, did you hear?

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:58.760
What?

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.150
The Harem-case that everybody is talking about.

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:02.370
A harem?!

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.820
Nice! Every man wants to experience a harem once in his li—

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:13.960
About the man who was living with numerous women of which many are still missing?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.550
They’ve been talking about it on TV all the time lately.

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:21.200
When the cops investigated the man’s residence last night...

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.210
...seven corpses were found.

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:24.640
Corpses?

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.340
So he really did it?!

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:29.910
So did that guy get caught?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.360
It looks like the cops let him get away.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:36.590
They said that we should stay alert because he might be wandering around here somewhere.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.720
Not something you want to hear from the Student Council.

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:41.890
This isn’t a good time to be moving out.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:46.160
But today is my only day off.

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:49.580
That man's apartment is at the next station, right?

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.090
This doesn’t feel real.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.570
I can’t believe those corpses have been so close to this place.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.960
In this house, the suspect has...

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.880
Only a few corpses have been found outside this city.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:13.350
Even if he would get the death penalty and died, his mystery would die with him.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.600
But this guy turned into a corpse.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.060
The cops are hiding it but...

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:24.410
It seems like he jumped off the twentieth floor of his mansion.

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:28.200
Alive...

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:29.980
I’m alive.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:31.930
I can’t die.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:33.040
I’m immortal!

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.120
A strong vibration...

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.830
He turned into a corpse that keeps on moving fiercely.

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.130
However...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:42.990
The cops cannot acknowledge such an existence.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.590
But he turned into a corpse.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.180
Corpses kill human beings.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:53.910
They get supernatural powers from their instinct.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:58.650
That is why we have come to you, Shugo.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.370
As always I shall investigate the matter.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:03.780
I’ll be enough.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.210
Monsters like you can only act carelessly.

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:09.530
Honda!

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.090
What I have to do doesn’t change anyway...

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:17.550
I just have to find and kill it!

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.980
You sure did a good job finding this.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.420
Above that, it was for free!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.370
They showed something on the news...

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.930
You’re talking about the Harem-case?

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.620
It’s women he’s after.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:48.910
Just be careful.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.990
Um... Manager...

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:54.560
Thank you for watching over me all this time.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:56.550
Oh you...

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:04.450
I’ll be off.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.360
One of the harem’s women has...?

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:32.200
Yes, one of them entered that building a while ago.

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:35.520
Does this mean that the criminal has summoned her?

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.670
The cops are looking for that woman too.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.980
I think we should hurry.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:47.180
What are you doing?!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.680
I died and have been resurrected.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.730
And I’ve become a vampire...

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:57.680
God has chosen me!

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:58.570
You’re wrong!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.020
You’re just another corpse!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.170
This can’t be.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.990
How can a corpse give life to another corpse?

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:10.820
I thought I told you...

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.910
I’ve become a vampire.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.250
I can create corpses.

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:22.030
Are they really corpses or are they just...?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:24.200
Do you want to become a corpse too?!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.200
What’s this?

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.410
You’re not human either.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:48.920
Makina!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.830
I need to get some help.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:19.390
But I’m sure somebody will steal my stuff while I’m gone.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:26.570
A person?

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:43.420
This can't be.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.260
It’s that girl from before.

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:48.170
That's right.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:50.760
It’s the same girl.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.140
But why?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:55.980
She’s dead.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:57.510
It's too late.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:00.280
But you aren’t scared.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.940
Because it has been shown to you...

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:05.200
You can't fear death.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.270
But you fear yourself because of that.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.660
What are you going to do?

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.470
That time, bro did something like this.

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.550
That is a corpse.

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:16.990
A lifeless object.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.270
I know that.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:19.230
But even so...

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.260
No!

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.200
Keisei.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.950
Who are you?

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.340
Your heart stopped...

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:01.390
Forget about this.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.820
It's still not beating.

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.910
Aren’t you scared knowing this?

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.210
But you’re alive.

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:15.120
Wait!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:18.970
Makina!

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:29.700
How are you feeling?

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:31.570
I'm fully recovered.

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:34.180
And now you're here with me.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.210
The corpse has been seen in the neighborhood.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.470
Can you go on?

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:39.280
Yes.

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:42.680
But try not to hurt the women around him.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:46.070
Corpses aren't contagious.

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:50.330
The women he abducted can't have become corpses.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:51.790
What was that then?

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:56.760
He has them in control by his charisma.

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:01.230
There is a big chance that he was bluffing about being a vampire.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.750
Whatever happened to them, they are still alive.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.630
And I'm not allowed to kill living things, right.

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:10.570
That isn't allowed for humans, corpses or anybody else!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:12.470
It came through Hagino’s place.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:14.090
What about the criminal?

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.360
Do you think he would kill one of them?

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:21.230
It is possible that he ordered the harem’s women to kill each other.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:22.560
But even so...

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:23.820
I know.

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:28.250
Those women are alive and I am not.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:35.390
You?!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:36.870
After falling from such a height...

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:38.880
So you must be...

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.620
Corpses like you have come to this world.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.040
Indeed, I am dead.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:48.760
I am a corpse created only to act, hunt down...

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:53.510
...and defeat man-killing corpses like you.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:58.730
They call me the fearful, merciless, despising, scorning...

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:00.270
"Shikabane Hime"

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:01.780
Note: "Shikabane Hime" means Corpse Princess.

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:48.870
And you’re the one who told me not to hurt them.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.980
I just put them to sleep safely.

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:55.440
Come here, corpse!

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:58.040
You’re the same as me.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:02.670
Devouring humans and living on to eternity.

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:08.060
Saying you and Makina are alike? That's ridiculous.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.290
Wait, Makina!

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:34.450
Watch out!

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.060
There is nothing I fear!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:48.590
Destroying the corpse's brain is the only way to defeat it.

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:50.410
Right now...

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:51.770
You feared me.

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:54.520
It's your loss!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:21.090
Note: The day that Kagami Oori became a man!

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:29.830
What's this? Geez.

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:49.770
I stink like a corpse.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.910
To be continued

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:29.080
People have forgotten death is all around us.

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:33.110
Because they can't live while thinking of it.

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:35.900
But they can't help but think of it.

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:35.910
The game continues.
But they can't help but think of it.

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:36.580
The game continues.

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:38.600
Next time, the game continues.
